Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's morning...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.98,0:00:11.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell fell off the bed again...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.69,0:00:15.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Hinata, why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.49,0:00:17.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.51,0:00:18.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.96,0:00:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,G'morning, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.04,0:00:27.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Morning. I'll go make breakfast,\Nso you get changed.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.99,0:00:29.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Change...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.05,0:00:35.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-At least wait until I leave the room!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.87,0:01:40.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's dig in!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.24,0:01:44.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a week since Bell got here.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.62,0:01:47.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I've gotten kinda used to living with her.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.99,0:01:51.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll be back later.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.76,0:01:54.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're leaving me all by my lonesome again...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.99,0:01:57.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I am a student, so...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.62,0:01:59.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should try getting out\Nevery once in a while, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.97,0:02:00.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.88,0:02:04.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All you've done since you got here\Nis read books.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.08,0:02:06.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You haven't gone exploring.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.08,0:02:08.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think you might learn more\Nby seeing some stuff in person.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.17,0:02:12.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm... you may have a point...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.48,0:02:15.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But the thing is, us elves...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.88,0:02:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can be particularly sensitive to fluctuations\Nin the emotions and attitudes of living beings.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.71,0:02:23.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The nerve of that dark elf,\Nout in broad daylight...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.87,0:02:23.57,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at that cute dark elf!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.57,0:02:25.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Humans are complex.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.62,0:02:30.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The good feelings and the bad get\Nall jumbled up and flow right into us.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.50,0:02:33.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it can even make us ill.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.57,0:02:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.32,0:02:38.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I got pretty used to it when we\Ntraveled as a party, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.57,0:02:40.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you give me just a little longer?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.49,0:02:45.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course. I'm sorry for trying to rush you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.00,0:02:48.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And-by-the-way!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.85,0:02:52.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The feelings in your heart are\Nvery compassionate and warm!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.68,0:02:54.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could bask in them forever!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.47,0:02:56.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell! I'm gonna be late!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.97,0:03:00.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll check out some more\Ninteresting books for you to read!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.34,0:03:01.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.58,0:03:03.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have a good day!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.50,0:03:12.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If she's going to live in this world,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.02,0:03:14.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's important for her to\Ninteract with people...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.41,0:03:15.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sunohara.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.70,0:03:19.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I can't go dragging her\Nout of the house if she isn't ready...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.32,0:03:22.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,U-Um, Sunohara?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.01,0:03:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, my bad! I was kinda lost in thought...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.88,0:03:27.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've been here a lot lately. Studying?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.52,0:03:30.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, this dark elf— er, I mean...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.21,0:03:32.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a friend visiting from overseas.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.21,0:03:34.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They mentioned wanting to\Nlearn about Japan, so...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.62,0:03:36.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.57,0:03:42.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"This is where humans of the same age\Nreceive an education together."
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.16,0:03:44.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Elven communities don't have that,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.49,0:03:48.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I feel like there was something\Nsimilar in the larger human towns...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.79,0:03:54.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need more Hinata Time.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.55,0:03:58.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hope Hinata comes home soon!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.01,0:04:00.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's for dinner tonight...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.03,0:04:02.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata's cooking is so yummy!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.46,0:04:06.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mm, but if I had the choice,\NI'd rather taste Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.22,0:04:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.13,0:04:08.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.29,0:04:12.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell's special Hinata talisman!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.46,0:04:16.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My precious Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.11,0:04:18.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you up to—
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.07,0:04:21.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Owie...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.59,0:04:23.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Sunohara, are you oka—
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.70,0:04:26.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.39,0:04:29.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After you went to the trouble of\Nhelping me organize the books...!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.01,0:04:32.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-It's fine. It was just an accident.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.17,0:04:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I admire you, Sunohara.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.42,0:04:44.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Always going out of your way to help people...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.25,0:04:46.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I do is screw things up.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.51,0:04:48.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.13,0:04:51.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You put your all into everything.\NI respect that about you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.13,0:04:59.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sunohara? Would you be interested in—
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.88,0:04:59.43,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Crap! I'm going to miss the supermarket sale!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.43,0:05:02.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gotta run, Mochida. See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.53,0:05:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Okay! See you tomorrow...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.98,0:05:15.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.44,0:05:20.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.84,0:05:22.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.74,0:05:25.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who was that woman?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.09,0:05:26.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-Which woman...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.51,0:05:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The one who was sitting on top of you...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.00,0:05:33.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about Mochida?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.21,0:05:35.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How did you know that—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.22,0:05:37.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A talisman? You were spying on me—?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.58,0:05:38.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I LOVE you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.97,0:05:41.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll make that woman pay...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.01,0:05:44.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That cutesy, "innocent as a lamb"\Nface of hers doesn't fool me...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.51,0:05:45.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.43,0:05:49.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...what I'll do.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.31,0:05:50.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.66,0:05:53.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to school with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.47,0:05:55.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone have you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.75,0:05:56.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.46,0:06:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right. There's no need to waste\Nmy time being sneaky about it!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.37,0:06:05.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll crush anyone who comes near you\Ninto pieces with my own two hands...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.70,0:06:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.92,0:06:08.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.67,0:06:11.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll keep you safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.33,0:06:17.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it gets Bell out of the house,\Neverything will be fine... hopefully.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.04,0:06:22.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But... I have a feeling things are\Ngoing to get complicated...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.69,0:06:30.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm from another world.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.06,0:06:31.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Mariabell.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.48,0:06:33.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa, she's an incredible cosplayer!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.75,0:06:38.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.91,0:06:40.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cosplay?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.44,0:06:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're okay with that explanation?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.67,0:06:45.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad you didn't have any issues\Nwith the transfer process.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.32,0:06:46.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.45,0:06:49.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to avoid "brainwashing"\Nanyone if I could help it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.67,0:06:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A disturbing choice of words...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.63,0:06:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe I ought to just leave\Nwell enough alone...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.42,0:06:56.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyways, Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.43,0:06:58.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here, open wide!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.43,0:07:01.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell, this isn't an appropriate place to...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.44,0:07:06.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? But if I do this, no one will\Nbe tempted to flirt with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.19,0:07:07.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flirt with me...?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.72,0:07:11.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to make friends with\Nthe people of this world, Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.70,0:07:14.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly content as long as I have you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.55,0:07:17.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's as intense as ever...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.70,0:07:19.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, now!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.27,0:07:21.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me, Sunohara...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.94,0:07:23.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mochida.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.49,0:07:26.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About those books you\Nchecked out the other day...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.32,0:07:29.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell! Uh, I'll introduce you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.28,0:07:31.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is Mochida, our library assistant.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.30,0:07:35.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura Mochida.\NI've heard a lot about you—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.58,0:07:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.58,0:07:39.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the ass that sat on Hinata's face...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.54,0:07:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-What on earth are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.42,0:07:44.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You used these curves to seduce Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.13,0:07:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unacceptable...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.33,0:07:47.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-Seduce him?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.22,0:07:48.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.80,0:07:51.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata belongs to me alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.14,0:07:52.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, no more...!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.87,0:08:06.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyone who dares come between\NHinata and me deserves to be—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.09,0:08:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,BELL!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.38,0:08:11.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What you're doing isn't okay, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.88,0:08:14.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-You don't understand, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.24,0:08:16.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That wasn't what I...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.33,0:08:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop it...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.71,0:08:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please don't look at me like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.35,0:08:23.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.97,0:08:25.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, Bell! Wait—!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.59,0:08:32.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.82,0:08:34.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.59,0:08:39.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was so terrified of her taking you away\Nfrom me that I acted without thinking...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.07,0:08:43.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The last thing I ever wanted was for you\Nto look so disappointed in me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.58,0:08:47.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I wanted was for Bell to get\Na better feel for this world,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.02,0:08:48.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I guess I shouldn't have—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.74,0:08:51.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-Mariabell!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.09,0:08:52.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.12,0:08:53.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mochida...?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.87,0:09:01.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mariabell, there's something\Nyou and I need to discuss!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.83,0:09:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Discuss?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.38,0:09:05.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, if it's about what I did, I'm sorry—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.97,0:09:08.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me, and be honest: Was that magic?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.94,0:09:15.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I suppose so—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.09,0:09:17.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way! So you weren't lying about\Nbeing from another world!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.95,0:09:22.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, actually, I've loved manga and\Nanime for my whole life,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.45,0:09:24.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I've always imagined\Nhow wonderful it'd be
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.31,0:09:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,if magic and all that\Nfantasy stuff were real!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.08,0:09:29.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was afraid of telling my friends\Nsince they might think it's cringe,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.16,0:09:31.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I've kept quiet about it lately...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.59,0:09:33.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But when I saw you this morning,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.96,0:09:38.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was so happy 'cause it's like,\N"Ah, elves are real!"
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.77,0:09:41.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus, you're gorgeous and\Nyou've got beautiful hair and skin!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.33,0:09:44.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't stop myself\Nfrom talking to you!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.83,0:09:46.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-Anyway...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.18,0:09:48.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you consider being my fwiend?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.43,0:09:56.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...Is that a no?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.45,0:10:03.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't care if she is the hero's companion.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.29,0:10:05.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd never want to hang around\Nsomeone like her.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.87,0:10:15.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you just stutter? That's hilarious!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.45,0:10:15.09,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.91,0:10:21.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess it's really not\Nthat important anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.10,0:10:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just "Bell" is fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.88,0:10:24.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Sakura.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.10,0:10:29.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.10,0:10:32.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey Bell, tell me more about\Nthe world you came from!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.97,0:10:34.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.11,0:10:35.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's it like there?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.55,0:10:36.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.55,0:10:38.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What other kinds of magic can you use?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.76,0:10:39.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, there's several—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.86,0:10:42.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What other races are there\Naside from elves?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.37,0:10:45.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.00,0:10:47.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, sowwy...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.44,0:10:51.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You remind me of a chipmunk.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.12,0:10:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A chipmunk? Sewiously...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.61,0:10:58.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well... I guess I'm just glad\Nshe made a friend.
